  }
 ],
 "takeaways": [
  "During melting the **temperature stays constant**; the heat breaks the lattice (latent heat).",
  "**Entropy rises** because an ordered solid becomes a disordered liquid.",
  "**\\( \\Delta S = Q/T \\)** at constant temperature."
 ],
 "notes": [
  {
   "title": "Connects to",
